{
  "id": 19,
  "title": "بَيْنَ يَعْقُوبَ وَأَبْنَائِهِ",
  "translation": "Between Ya'qub and His Sons",
  "source": "Qisas an-Nabiyeen (Story 2: Sayyiduna Yusuf AS)",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "s2_c19_s1",
      "order": 1,
      "text": "وَرَجَعُوا إِلَى أَبِيهِمْ وَأَخْبَرُوهُ بِالْخَبَرِ وَقَالُوا لَهُ: أَرْسِلْ مَعَنَا أَخَانَا، وَإِلَّا لَا نَجِدُ خَيْرًا عِنْدَ الْعَزِيزِ.",
      "translation": "And they returned to their father and informed him of the news, saying to him: 'Send our brother with us, otherwise we will find no good with the Aziz.'",
